bkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"27d4010490c43feb2523823f1635ae0e5b653738dfc31df64fd08a99b92674b9","event_uuid":"9adfa1da-1e95-4a64-8206-20994dcee83a","position":{"commit_sha":"0e4d04fce0872325094f61c0b994d82c88653e98","position":"1785457615766697001-9adfa1da-1e95-4a64-8206-20994dcee83a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"7bb0ecb02e2478137f1c603c4dee8a74f162e90dbb750cfd8bcaa4a65f5dad77","event_uuid":"418e62d9-e9b5-4bc4-9f24-8aea058f9a59","position":{"commit_sha":"0e4d04fce0872325094f61c0b994d82c88653e98","position":"1785457615800064001-418e62d9-e9b5-4bc4-9f24-8aea058f9a59"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1785457353606100001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Why\n\nBug 449f-f9bf-be90-47fe fixed two Reconcile Bridge failure modes in code (landed as bcd888352, Gerrit 1072), proven by RED->GREEN unit oracles with mutation checks. What code tests cannot prove is that the failures stop occurring in production — that needs a post-fix run sample, which did not exist at close time because the fix had just landed.\n\nThis task carries that measurement so 449f does not stay open indefinitely waiting on wall-clock, and so the verification is not silently dropped.\n\n## What to measure\n\nOver a window of >= 500 `Reconcile Bridge` runs after 2026-07-31T00:30Z:\n\n- Mode 1 (lock-lease loss): zero runs failing with `reconcile heartbeat lost the lease` / `pass lock lease lost mid-pass`. Expect these to now appear as `::notice::Reconcile rescheduled (exit 75)` on a GREEN run instead of a red one — confirm the notice IS appearing, so we know the path is being exercised and not merely absent.\n- Mode 3 (outbound 404): zero runs failing with `reconcile_once raised: HTTP Error 404`. If a 404 occurs, confirm it is recorded as a per-mutation `stale-binding-404` outcome and the pass continued.\n\nEvidence: `gh run list --workflow=reconcile-bridge.yml` inventory with counts, plus the specific run ids for any mode-1 notice observed.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] A post-fix sample of >= 500 Reconcile Bridge runs is inventoried and recorded on this ticket.\n- [ ] Zero failures attributable to mode 1 (lock-lease loss) in that window.\n- [ ] Zero failures attributable to mode 3 (outbound 404 aborting the pass) in that window.\n- [ ] The mode-1 benign path is confirmed EXERCISED (an exit-75 notice observed), not merely absent — otherwise the sample proves nothing about it.\n- [ ] If any recurrence is found, a bug is filed and linked rather than the criterion being waived.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"9adfa1da-1e95-4a64-8206-20994dcee83a","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"reverts":[],"status":"deleted","tags":[],"ticket_id":"597e-511c-0e0f-420d","ticket_type":"task","title":"Post-fix production verification: confirm Reconcile Bridge mode-1/mode-3 failures stop recurring","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["a26916f0-5fb7-44b0-8d05-cea97f8e4cb8","7c167834-4793-440d-a4af-00aced951a92","3f60ce55-10d4-45c4-9f05-974df2217f7f","9adfa1da-1e95-4a64-8206-20994dcee83a","418e62d9-e9b5-4bc4-9f24-8aea058f9a59"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786659596570635001,"uuid":"b6e98933-b910-49fa-9db6-9448767c1b78"}